{"title": "BAN LIST", "pageid": 12773, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/BAN_LIST", "categories": ["Books", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Tome_Y_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Book_Tome_Y_Image.png/300px-Book_Tome_Y_Image.png.webp, /w/images/3/33/Book_Tome_Y_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"BAN LIST image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Book_Tome_Y_Image.png/300px-Book_Tome_Y_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/33/Book_Tome_Y_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>BAN LIST</b> is a NO EXCEPTIONS list of people who MUST NOT be permitted on <a href=\"/wiki/The_Waning_Moon\" title=\"The Waning Moon\">The Waning Moon</a> premises.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A list of customers banned from the Waning Moon distillery.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/38px-Books_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/50px-Books_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Books\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Books_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\">Books</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-ca71ee9b5657dc35END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-2f6c2af318224910END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_TWN_Distillery_BannedCustomers</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_TWN_Distillery_BannedCustomers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_TWN_Distillery_BannedCustomers\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">cdbd0273-7e91-4ac8-b562-8a7bbc61c239</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cdbd0273-7e91-4ac8-b562-8a7bbc61c239\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cdbd0273-7e91-4ac8-b562-8a7bbc61c239\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a countertop in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Waning_Moon\" title=\"The Waning Moon\">The Waning Moon</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-192&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-93</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>BARRED FROM ENTRY\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nThe following EX-customers are UNWELCOME. Do not let them in, even should they beg. ESPECIALLY should they beg.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nMartin Doughty - human? - chug-and-run\n</p><p><br>\nAdam Smythe - lascivious behaviour, also known as 'The Pickle Incident'\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Gerringothe Thorm</a> - SHE KNOWS WHAT SHE DID\n</p><p><br>\nKavin Ort - tall dwarf - exceedingly boring\n</p><p><br>\nSyrah Bee - short half-elf - vomited on the waiter (purposefully)\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Unknown elf</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> - pale skin, snide mouth - referring to master distiller as 'the porcine publican'\n</p><p><br>\nRochelle Kwark - halfling - groin-punching\n</p><p><br>\nYon Von Don (suspected alias) - grotesquely tall human - underpants on head\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The names on <b>BAN LIST</b> are the writers of <i>Baldur's Gate 3</i> poking fun at themselves, as confirmed by writer Kevin VanOrd<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>:\n<ul><li>'Martin Doughty' (Martin Docherty)</li>\n<li>'Adam Smythe' (Adam Smith)</li>\n<li>'Kavin Ort' (Kevin VanOrd)</li>\n<li>'Syrah Bee' (Sarah Baylus)</li>\n<li>'Rochelle Kwark' (Rachel Quirke)</li>\n<li>'Yon Von Don' (Jan Van Dosselaer)</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">VanOrd, Kevin. 2023. \"And yes the unknown elf is who you think it is.\" [@fiddlecub, Twitter]. 14 Oct 2023. Available from: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20231017062203/https://twitter.com/fiddlecub/status/1713103448516812817\">https://web.archive.org/web/20231017062203/https://twitter.com/fiddlecub/status/1713103448516812817</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">VanOrd, Kevin. 2023. \"As the book's writer I can confirm it was a juicy act indeed. All the names (aside from Gerringothe's, of course) are based on Larian writers. I can literally tag myself as Kavin Ort, the boring dwarf!\" [@fiddlecub, Twitter]. 14 Oct 2023. Available from: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240329212133/https://twitter.com/fiddlecub/status/1713103283026383083\">https://web.archive.org/web/20240329212133/https://twitter.com/fiddlecub/status/1713103283026383083</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714211331\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1254/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25535/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8172/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 312/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 937418/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.550      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   38.550      1 -total\n 47.37%   18.262      5 Template:Icon_text\n 42.54%   16.400     13 Template:Trim\n 24.47%    9.434      2 Template:Uid\n 16.85%    6.495      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.56%    5.614      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.88%    4.196      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.79%    4.159      1 Template:Books\n 10.74%    4.142      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12773-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714211331 and revision id 284949. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}